    "text": "Real talk. You're a small business owner, you finally decide to run your first TikTok ad, and then you open ads manager and think, wait, does it need a rocket science degree for this? Yeah, that was me. But turns out you don't need a desktop, a theme, or a marketing degree. You just need your phone. Let me show you. Step one, just log in with your TikTok account, no password, no hassle. Step two, pick your goal. Maybe you want more traffic, more sales, whatever matters most for your business. Step three, set a small budget. You can start low, and scale up later. That's it. No ad degree required. And if you're a new advertiser, you can actually grab some free ad credits to help kick things off. So you're not jumping in blind. Tap the link below, launch your first ad from your phone, and see how easy it actually is. Seriously, just try it.",
